    "summary": {
      "value": "Delicacies, potions and spells heal above maximum HP and MP."
    },
    "description": "<p><strong>Requirements:</strong> you must have mastered <strong>Gourmet</strong>, <strong>Loremaster</strong>, <strong>Merchant</strong>, or <strong>Tinkerer</strong>.</p><hr><p><strong>Potions</strong> and <strong>delicacies</strong> you create, as well as <strong>spells</strong> you cast, can now cause creatures to recover Hit Points and Mind Points beyond their <strong>maximum HP and MP</strong> scores, up to 150% of the respective scores. At the end of each scene, if the <strong>current Hit Points and/or Mind Points</strong> of a creature are still above the maximum scores, they become equal to the maximum score.</p>",
